OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1791989774
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Every cost has gone up': Science
OL,4,Amuseum on the brink
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince opening in 1987, the museum has
OL,7,Fbeen the UK's only site dedicated to
OL,8,Ftelling the story of the chemical
OL,9,Findustry. It welcomes about 30,000
OL,10,Fvisitors a year to explore interactive
OL,11,Fexhibits and take part in workshops.
OL,13,FBut Mallott said admission fees "only
OL,14,Fcover 15% of running costs" and that
OL,15,Fthe museum now needed donations or
OL,16,Fsponsors to stay open.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
